      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以……这样一来……届时……\r\n能请您和变强之后的我，再一起奔跑吗……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d09fd6d5f963f56fa547ef39e94d68e66beeb17c6d3423a89c3c691792fa160",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
