    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d9b07ae8d0065ae3aa61a67",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为这里面记载着我迄今为止所学到的一切嘛。\r\n既然要“战斗”，那自然是要动用全部力量啦……什么的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2eb3ebb76d9e952fbac8e031cae1b0ff919d8b110e5509b3a101f2d308804740",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
