    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d309459d87cb124434cf1bab",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这一切都多亏了您！是您让我回忆起了我对丸善小姐的憧憬！\r\n如果您当时没有从背后推我那一把的话……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6056bcc0fc3fc68bdd94cdd3531d3e80057233735f0e8443f5970780c16374ef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1069/storytimeline_041069004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
