      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/53/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4702f9c7a2376814dff7347a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以！在我成长之后，再度和丸善小姐一决胜负的时候……\r\n我希望您也陪在我身边！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2b2804df52116e0785e691237270c7e35750de15e82fd1aeeffd28aad3635c7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1069/storytimeline_041069004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        53,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/53/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e14531115f1f4ad382e30e5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我才是，请你以后多多关照啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b1fb2223b54fff0dde89f78445688ddb0ba11255ed43ab8811321a59fa4d64b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
