      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "已经亲眼见过她这般一心向前迈进的心意，而我也想继续见证她的成长。\r\n……根本没有拒绝的理由呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb79174e1e1f12d498a501102af232025fe606e07f3b59559266ad9daf140e8f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
