      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哇啊……成、成功了～非常感谢！\r\n呃，既然如此……就赶紧思考一条作为纪念的格言吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9a35c4ce7e55807099fdc953fdd25fba99c120dc6376db27d7c6c83c2945946",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
